  "description": "The component CATALOG of a Finding pebble (a dated, append-only evidence report — a problem OR a pass proof — attached to the spec/code it concerns): each content component and WHAT belongs under it — severity, category, state (disposition), the DERIVED status, and the markdown body's sections (Observation, Evidence, Impact, Root cause, Solution, Solution steps) — plus the pebble-level parts, the append-only / supersede model, and every finding-related pebbles-cli command. A DEFINITION reference skills point at; method lives elsewhere. Findings reference no rules.",
